# 🤖 Customer FAQ AI Bot

An AI-powered Customer FAQ Bot built with **AI Agent, Pinecone Vector Store, and n8n**.

## 📌 Project Overview

This project is designed to answer customer questions using previously stored knowledge and FAQ data.

The AI Agent searches the relevant information from the **Pinecone Vector Store** and generates an answer based on the retrieved data.

The main goal is to provide accurate and reliable answers without allowing the AI to invent information that does not exist in the knowledge base.

## ⚙️ How It Works

```text
User Question
      ↓
    AI Agent
      ↓
Pinecone Vector Store
      ↓
Relevant Data Retrieval
      ↓
AI Agent analyzes the data
      ↓
Accurate Customer Answer
